# REQUIRES: python-api, jax, torch
# mdir.jax against mdir.torch.evaluate on the same programs and frames
# (D371), on the CPU, in the deterministic mode, double and
# mixed precision, Inputs/python_frames_jax.py: an interpreter with PyTorch
# writes the energies of three frames of the dipeptide and their gradients
# (in the positions, the edges of the cells, and the tunables, under a
# cotangent of weights) and those of water in a triclinic cell; the
# interpreter with JAX gives the same numbers, to the bit. The two adapters
# form the gradient in the cell with one function of the extension.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide torch-dump Double CPU %t/double.npz | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DUMP -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: env JAX_PLATFORMS=cpu %jax_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide torch-compare Double CPU %t/double.npz | FileCheck %s -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide torch-dump Mixed CPU %t/mixed.npz | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DUMP -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# RUN: env JAX_PLATFORMS=cpu %jax_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide torch-compare Mixed CPU %t/mixed.npz | FileCheck %s -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# DUMP: [[MODE]]: mdir.torch.evaluate written
# DUMP: torch passed
# CHECK: [[MODE]]: against mdir.torch.evaluate, the energies, to the bit: True
# CHECK: [[MODE]]: against mdir.torch.evaluate, the gradient in the positions, to the bit: True
# CHECK: [[MODE]]: against mdir.torch.evaluate, the gradient in the edges of the cells, to the bit: True
# CHECK: [[MODE]]: against mdir.torch.evaluate, the gradient in params under a cotangent of ones (the VJP), to the bit: True
# CHECK: [[MODE]]: against mdir.torch.evaluate, the energy in a triclinic cell, to the bit: True
# CHECK: [[MODE]]: against mdir.torch.evaluate, the gradient in its diagonal and its tilts, to the bit: True
# CHECK: [[MODE]]: against mdir.torch.evaluate, its gradient in params, to the bit: True
# CHECK: [[MODE]]: against mdir.torch.evaluate, the gradient in params under a cotangent of weights: largest relative difference
# CHECK: jax passed
